{
  "$doctrine": "cognition_guardrails — single source of truth across web (Vite), mobile (Expo), and backend/CI (Python). DO NOT duplicate these strings anywhere else. All three layers (static / DOM / structural) read from this file. Adding to the lists tightens the guardrail; removing requires explicit doctrine review.",

  "forbidden_lexicon": {
    "$comment": "Words/phrases that MUST NOT appear in customer-facing surface copy. The mapper is the only source of customer text; any of these strings leaking into a surface means an operational/telemetry/AI/urgency word has crossed the boundary. Matching is case-insensitive substring on visible inner_text AND attributes (aria-label, placeholder, title, alt).",

